  "description": "Bom dreams of becoming an adult webtoon writer, but she has never felt thrilled by real men. The only thing that makes her heart beat is her first love, 'Jeong Tae-yang', whom she has only touched in her dreams for 8 years... But suddenly, the man appeared in front of her. \n\nWhen we started living together to win an adult webtoon contest, the first words that I threw out were, 'Is it so important to have no experience?' \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
